  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">UPHESC Assistant Professor Result 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-09T21:54:48+05:30\">June 9, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">9:54 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a title=\"UPHESC 2022\" href=\"https://uphesc51.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Uttar Pradesh Higher Education Service Commission (UPHESC)</a></strong>, has released the <strong data-start=\"216\" data-end=\"237\">Result</strong> on the <strong>official website</strong> for the recruitment of <strong data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"308\">Assistant Professor</strong> posts. The exam was conducted on <strong data-start=\"371\" data-end=\"412\">18 – 19 April 2026</strong>. The&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"446\">UPHESC application process</strong>&nbsp;started on&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"478\">09 July 2022</strong>, and candidates were able to submit their applications until&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"560\">29 August 2022</strong>. Candidates can check their <strong data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"620\">Result</strong>&nbsp;using their&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"693\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;by logging into the portal. The <strong>direct link</strong> is provided below.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">UPHESC Assistant Professor Result 2026 – Out</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">UPHESC Assistant Professor Examination 2022 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/uphesc-assistant-professor-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date :<b> 09 July 2022</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date :<b> 29 August 2022</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date of Fee Payment :<b> 30 August 2022</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Form Completion Last Date : <strong>31 August 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">New Exam Date : <strong>18-19 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>08 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Admit Card Date</span><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> : </span>15 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Answer Key : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>22 April 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Result Declared Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">09 June 2026 Available Now</span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">For<strong> General / OBC / EWS</strong>&nbsp;: <strong>₹ </strong><strong>2000/-&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">For<strong> SC / ST</strong>&nbsp;: <strong>₹ 1000</strong><strong>/-&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-tex